<view class="pageDemo"><mx-nav title="轮播" /><view style="height:{{navHeight}}px;"></view><view class="demoIntro"><desc type="name" text="Swiper">Swiper</desc><desc>用于宣传图或广告图的轮播切换。</desc></view><wrap><title type="h2">基本用法</title><mx-swiper options="{{options}}" showDots="{{true}}" bind:swiper_change="handleChange" bind:swiper_transition="bindTransition" bind:swiper_animation_finish="bindAnimationFinish" /></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">数据项</title><desc type="prop" text="options">options</desc><desc type="prop" text="options[x].img">options[x].img</desc><desc type="value" text="Banner图片地址">Banner图片地址</desc><desc type="prop" text="options[x].url">options[x].url</desc><desc type="value" text="跳转页面地址">跳转页面地址</desc></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">swiper宽度</title><desc type="prop" text="width">width</desc><desc type="value" text="默认750rpx">默认750rpx</desc><mx-swiper options="{{options}}" showDots="{{true}}" width="640rpx" dotBottom="78" radius="8" /></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">swiper高度</title><desc type="prop" text="height">height</desc><desc type="value" text="默认320rpx">默认320rpx</desc></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">swiper圆角</title><desc type="prop" text="radius">radius</desc></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">是否自动切换</title><desc type="prop" text="autoplay">autoplay</desc><desc type="value" text="默认true">默认true</desc><mx-swiper options="{{options}}" showDots="{{true}}" autoplay="{{false}}" /></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">当前所在滑块</title><desc type="prop" text="current">current</desc><desc type="value" text="默认0">默认0</desc></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">自动切换间隔</title><desc type="prop" text="interval">interval</desc><desc type="value" text="默认5000，毫秒">默认5000，毫秒</desc></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">滑动动画时长</title><desc type="prop" text="duration">duration</desc><desc type="value" text="默认500，毫秒">默认500，毫秒</desc></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">是否采用衔接滑动</title><desc type="prop" text="circular">circular</desc><mx-swiper options="{{options}}" showDots="{{true}}" circular="{{true}}" /></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">swiper 切换缓动动画类型</title><desc type="prop" text="easingFunction">easingFunction</desc><desc type="value" text="default 默认缓动函数、linear 线性动画、easeInCubic 缓入动画、easeOutCubic 缓出动画、easeInOutCubic 缓入缓出动画">default 默认缓动函数、linear 线性动画、easeInCubic 缓入动画、easeOutCubic 缓出动画、easeInOutCubic 缓入缓出动画</desc><desc>default 默认缓动函数</desc><mx-swiper options="{{options}}" showDots="{{true}}" easingFunction="default" /><line /><desc>linear 线性动画</desc><mx-swiper options="{{options}}" showDots="{{true}}" easingFunction="linear" /><line /><desc>easeInCubic 缓入动画</desc><mx-swiper options="{{options}}" showDots="{{true}}" easingFunction="easeInCubic" /><line /><desc>easeOutCubic 缓出动画</desc><mx-swiper options="{{options}}" showDots="{{true}}" easingFunction="easeOutCubic" /><line /><desc>easeInOutCubic 缓入缓出动画</desc><mx-swiper options="{{options}}" showDots="{{true}}" easingFunction="easeInOutCubic" /><line /></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">同时显示的滑块数量</title><desc type="prop" text="displayMultipleItems">displayMultipleItems</desc><desc type="value" text="默认1个">默认1个</desc></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">前边距，可用于露出前一项的一小部分</title><desc type="prop" text="previousMargin">previousMargin</desc><desc type="value" text="支持px和rpx">支持px和rpx</desc></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">后边距，可用于露出后一项的一小部分</title><desc type="prop" text="nextMargin">nextMargin</desc><desc type="value" text="支持px和rpx">支持px和rpx</desc></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">是否显示指示点</title><desc type="prop" text="showDots">showDots</desc><desc type="value" text="默认true显示">默认true显示</desc></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">指示点距离底部距离</title><desc type="prop" text="dotBottom">dotBottom</desc><desc type="value" text="数字，使用rpx">数字，使用rpx</desc></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">指示点颜色</title><desc type="prop" text="dotColor">dotColor</desc></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">指示点选中颜色</title><desc type="prop" text="dotActiveColor">dotActiveColor</desc></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">指示点形状</title><desc type="prop" text="dotShape">dotShape</desc><desc type="value" text="circle 圆形 / square 方型 / bar 条形">circle 圆形 / square 方型 / bar 条形</desc><desc>circle 圆形</desc><mx-swiper options="{{options}}" showDots="{{true}}" dotShape="circle" /><line /><desc>square 方型</desc><mx-swiper options="{{options}}" showDots="{{true}}" dotShape="square" /><line /><desc>bar 条形</desc><mx-swiper options="{{options}}" showDots="{{true}}" dotShape="bar" /></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">指示点自定义宽高圆角</title><desc type="prop" text="dotWidth">dotWidth</desc><desc type="value" text="高度，数字，不带单位，使用rpx">高度，数字，不带单位，使用rpx</desc><desc type="prop" text="dotHeight">dotHeight</desc><desc type="value" text="宽度，数字，不带单位，使用rpx">宽度，数字，不带单位，使用rpx</desc><desc type="prop" text="dotRadius">dotRadius</desc><desc type="value" text="圆角，数字，不带单位，使用rpx">圆角，数字，不带单位，使用rpx</desc><mx-swiper options="{{options}}" showDots="{{true}}" dotWidth="30" dotHeight="16" dotRadius="4" /><line /></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">指示点边框颜色</title><desc type="prop" text="dotBorderColor">dotBorderColor</desc><desc type="value" text="边框颜色">边框颜色</desc><desc type="prop" text="dotBorderActiveColor">dotBorderActiveColor</desc><desc type="value" text="选中边框颜色">选中边框颜色</desc><mx-swiper options="{{options}}" showDots="{{true}}" dotBorderColor="#FFF" dotBorderActiveColor="#CA0E2D" dotColor="#CA0E2D" dotActiveColor="transparent" /><line /></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">点击时是否使用自定义事件</title><desc type="prop" text="customHandle">customHandle</desc><line /></wrap><wrap><title type="h2">事件</title><desc type="prop" text="bind:swiper_change">bind:swiper_change</desc><desc type="value" text="值改变事件">值改变事件</desc><desc type="prop" text="bind:swiper_transition">bind:swiper_transition</desc><desc type="value" text="swiper-item 的位置发生改变时触发">swiper-item 的位置发生改变时触发</desc><desc type="prop" text="bind:swiper_animation_finish">bind:swiper_animation_finish</desc><desc type="value" text="动画结束时触发">动画结束时触发</desc><desc type="prop" text="bind:swiper_tap">bind:swiper_tap</desc><desc type="value" text="点击事件，需配合customHandle字段使用">点击事件，需配合customHandle字段使用</desc><line /></wrap><prop-table dataSource="{{propDocs}}" /></view>